 ex=("How do we know the Indus people traded with distant lands?",[("Indus seals and beads have been found in Mesopotamia.","Goods travelled far."),("Lothal had a dockyard for ships.","It shows sea trade."),("So they traded with far lands.","Evidence comes from objects found.")]),
 tb=("A friend asks what a seal was used for. How will you explain?",["It was a small stone stamp with a picture and signs.","It marked goods to show who owned them."],["Thinking seals were only toys."]),
